{"id":"b55affe36ee4719a","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-arity.md","title":"Arity","display":"df-arity — Arity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-arity","aliases":["57-df-arity"],"display":"df-arity — Arity","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-arity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-arity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arity — Arity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arity-—-Arity-$\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)$\">df-arity — Arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a> 的互不相交符号分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}\\)</span> 只在函数、常量和关系符号上定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,n\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ar}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,n\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}:\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ar}:\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_S\\; (\\mathrm{ar}(f)=n\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\; (\\mathrm{ar}(R)=n\\leftrightarrow R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_S\\; (\\mathrm{ar}(f)=n\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\; (\\mathrm{ar}(R)=n\\leftrightarrow R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{arity}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ar}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{arity}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ar}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>元数相同不表示符号属于同一类别；函数、关系的类别由上游分区决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arity-—-Arity-$\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)$","text":"df-arity — Arity $\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的互不相交符号分量；$\\mathrm{ar}$ 只在函数、常量和关系符号上定义，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,n\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}:\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_S\\; (\\mathrm{ar}(f)=n\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)),\\\\\n&\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\; (\\mathrm{ar}(R)=n\\leftrightarrow R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{arity}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ar}.","display":true}],"bytes":1009,"backlinks":[{"id":"9c607e2e3c013a11","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-arity]])"},{"id":"c3641f7a442206b5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 固定，$\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle$，$I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)$，$f_i^{\\mathfrak F}=g(i)$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]。$\\tau=\\mathrm{arity}\\upharpoonright I$，$n_i=\\tau(i)$，见 [[57-df-arity]]；元数映射的输入是符号 $i$，不是解释后的函数 $f_i^{\\mathfrak F}$。$\\sigma:F\\to F$；$\\bar x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{n_i}\\rangle\\in F^{n_i}$，$\\sigma(\\bar x)=\\langle\\sigma(x_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(x_{n_i})\\rangle$ 为逐分量作用，$F^F$ 为从 $F$ 到 $F$ 的函数集合。"},{"id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-arity]])"},{"id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表；$I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)$ 取 [[57-df-function]]，只含正元函数符号；$n_i=\\mathrm{arity}(i)$ 取 [[57-df-arity]]。\n$F$ 是候选抽象载体，$g$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的候选运算族，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle$；不预设 $F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 是显式固定的候选支持映射，其定义域包含当前候选载体且 $\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}$；$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 时采用 [[57-df-free-variable]] 的映射。该支持映射为本谓词的固定环境参数。$f_i^{\\mathfrak F}$ 和 $|\\mathfrak F_S|$ 使用下式的相应投影接口。"},{"id":"cb21c77571b2da10","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$、$n\\ge1$、$f\\in S$；符号分量、元数与函数符号集合分别见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-arity]]、[[57-df-function]]。"},{"id":"9a59657cbfef22b5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 及 $\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{ar}$ 见 [[57-df-arity]]。此处 $\\mathrm{Func}(S)$ 是正元函数符号集合，不是集合函数类。"},{"id":"afc42c965ba86683","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"658bea3e76b250ff","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f5604bfa28fe2ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$、$n\\ge1$、$R\\in S$；符号分量及元数见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-arity]]。"},{"id":"4744f89052b0cbdb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d06cd82e12837aa5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $S$ 的全部非逻辑符号分量，见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-arity]]、[[57-df-constant]]、[[57-df-function]]。"},{"id":"fcdd3e992e132d58","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$ 及其全延拓 $\\widehat\\theta$ 见 [[57-df-substitution]]；$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$、$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}$、$f\\i